\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {18}{\ignorespaces Six verified with-tools episodes from the released corpus (five pathology, one healthy negative control), from two institutions. Each pathology panel shows the episode in context (expert box green, box returned by \texttt  {locate\_tooth} blue, box after the \texttt  {nudge\_crop} chain orange) and the crops the policy inspected before and after correcting; the header gives the offset tier, the number of nudges, and the IoU with the full-tooth expert box. (a) A three-nudge inspect--correct--re-inspect loop; (b) one nudge among 15 findings and 42 tool calls; (c) a deep-caries tooth with a three-step chain; (d) a Tufts periapical lesion; (e) a small-offset judgment call; (f) a healthy scan cleared without a hallucinated finding. Tiers are the logged perturbation tiers (confirmed by the box geometry), and a policy that also rescales to focus can show a lower IoU than the displacement it recovered. Crops are native-resolution views of the box with 30\% padding (illustrative of the zoom tool, not the canonical-view geometry).}}{25}{figure.caption.35}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:gallery}{{18}{25}{Six verified with-tools episodes from the released corpus (five pathology, one healthy negative control), from two institutions. Each pathology panel shows the episode in context (expert box green, box returned by \texttt {locate\_tooth} blue, box after the \texttt {nudge\_crop} chain orange) and the crops the policy inspected before and after correcting; the header gives the offset tier, the number of nudges, and the IoU with the full-tooth expert box. (a) A three-nudge inspect--correct--re-inspect loop; (b) one nudge among 15 findings and 42 tool calls; (c) a deep-caries tooth with a three-step chain; (d) a Tufts periapical lesion; (e) a small-offset judgment call; (f) a healthy scan cleared without a hallucinated finding. Tiers are the logged perturbation tiers (confirmed by the box geometry), and a policy that also rescales to focus can show a lower IoU than the displacement it recovered. Crops are native-resolution views of the box with 30\% padding (illustrative of the zoom tool, not the canonical-view geometry)}{figure.caption.35}{}}
\newlabel{fig:gallery@cref}{{[figure][18][]18}{[1][24][]25}}
